written.

Before `bsm-core` / `bsm-spring-boot-starter` / `bsm-demo` are published to
any repository outside this monorepo's immediate control, this file MUST be
replaced with an actual license text (e.g. Apache-2.0, MIT, or a proprietary
company license) chosen by whoever owns the legal decision for this
codebase. Until that happens, treat this project as "all rights reserved,
internal use only" — do not redistribute the published artifacts outside
